SUMMARY:The Early Autumn Earl Bales Leisure Social Walk (with Dinner After
 )
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s for a very relaxing and fun leisure nature walk through **Earl Bales Par
 k.** A beautiful and tranquil walk just off of Bathurst just south of Shep
 pard. (Easy access by Bathurst Bus and plenty of free parking\, near commu
 nity centre)\n\n\\*We will meet out front the **Earl Bales Community Centr
 e at 4169 Bathurst Street**\n\n\\*To find us-enter the park by car or walk
 ing and stay in the left lane until you get to the Earl Bales Community Ce
 ntre (simply park your car and join us there)\n\\*Washrooms inside\n\\*We 
 will arrive and hang out there from 3:00 pm -3:30 pm as everyone arrives (
 do your best to arrive at 3:00 pm- then we will begin our leisure nature w
 alk through Earl Bales park\; eventually returning where we started from\n
 \nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\
 n**Event Details:**\n\n**The Early Autumn Earl Bales Leisure Social Walk (
 with Dinner After)**\nBonus: (Satruday Night Dinner & Beverages After :)\n
 \n\\*We can stop and rest at different spots\, take some lovely scenic pho
 tos and share some laughs\n\\*Perhaps play a couple ice breaker games as w
 ell to help build some bonds\n\\*This is always a great way to casually an
 d naturally make new connections and release all your stress as we walk th
 rough the park\n\n\\*Stick around after if you like as we will go to a Pub
 /Restaurant at 1999 Avenue Road\n\n\\*Those taking the bus- plenty of driv
 ers including myself will be happy to drive you to the restaurant after :)
 \n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive\nor etransfer 
 in advance to Steveflemming11@gmail.com\n\\*If you can't make walk but wis
 h to take part in the mingle after you can email me or text me- event fee 
 still applies\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\n\n**Time and Location: Where to meet us?**\n\nArrive between 3:00
  pm and 3:30 pm\nEarl Bales Community Centre at 4169 Bathurst Street\n\\*s
 tay in left lane when entering the park\, drive to the end where you will 
 see the Community Centre (We will be out front the Centre- with washrooms 
 inside the building)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 n\n*Thanks for reading everyone\; remember to RSVP and see you real soon!*
  :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
