SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Autumn Mix and Mingle Dinner Party! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a fun and relaxed Saturday night of good food\, great conve
 rsation and new connections! Come on your own or bring a friend and enjoy 
 an easygoing autumn evening with new and old friends alike.\n\n\\*Joined b
 y my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out wi
 th lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*Please note we 
 are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 block
 s north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area o
 r on the patio\, depending on weather and numbers)**\n\n*\\*You can ask th
 e bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's d
 inner party)*\n\n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphe
 re!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Detai
 ls Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Det
 ails:\n**🎉** **The Saturday Night Autumn Mix and Mingle Dinner Party**\
 n**(Saturday\, September 26th\, 2026)**\n\nWe’re getting together at The
  Pheasant on Avenue Road for our **Saturday Night Autumn Mix and Mingle Di
 nner Party!**\nThis is a casual social evening where you can enjoy dinner 
 and drinks while meeting new people in a comfortable and friendly atmosphe
 re. Whether you're new to the group or one of our regulars\, you're very w
 elcome to join us.\n\n• 🍽️ Enjoy dinner and drinks\n• 🍂 Relaxe
 d autumn social atmosphere\n• 👋 Meet new people and make new friends\
 n• 💬 Plenty of time to mix\, mingle and chat\n• 👫 Singles\, coup
 les and friends are all welcome\n• 😊 Come alone — many of our membe
 rs do!\n\nLooking forward to another enjoyable Saturday night together!\nH
 osted by Steve Flemming (Soul City Social Club)\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dolla
 rs (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemmi
 ng11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for those attending the 3 pm walk :)\
 n\\*No extra charge if you are staying for Karaoke as well\n\n**Friendly R
 eminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:00 pm and 7:00 pm (please ask fo
 r Steve when you arrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided
 :\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue 
 and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfir
 kin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply 
 take bus or uber from the station)
