SUMMARY:**FAMILY FEUD** (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out for fabulous Sunday afternoon\; with our belove
 d party game\, **Family Feud (Simply the Best Social Game in Town!)**\n\n-
 It's going to be a total blast with a group social game designed to keep u
 s laughing and interacting all afternoon\n\n\\*Super easy to learn\, play 
 and have fun- no experience required!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social gro
 ups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\nEvent Details Below:
 \n\nSincerely\,\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\
 n**Details of Event:**\n\n**\\*\\*FAMILY FEUD\\*\\* (Simply the Best Socia
 l Game in Town!)**\n\n-Lots of laughs in store as we have a great afternoo
 n making new friends and playing **Family Feud** hosted in a unique group 
 vs group format\n\n-Groups will be divided into groups of 4-6 players\, wi
 th multiple rounds played\n\n\\*Chocolate handed out to the winning teams 
 after each round we play\n\\*\\* Invite your friends or come on your own\;
  either way we can anticipate a great time!\n***It's all about having fun 
 and laughing a lot :)***\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash o
 nly please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **steveflemming
 11@gmail.com**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Date:** Sunday\, September 27th\n**Arrival Time:** Please
  arrive between 2:00 p.m. -2:45 p.m.\nLocation: The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub
  (1999 Avenue - Just south of 401)\n\\*Great lunch/dinner menu with food/d
 rink specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival t
 o support venue)\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parki
 ng on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://www.firkinpubs.com/the
 pheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/)\n(15
 -20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or
  uber from the station)
