SUMMARY:The Sunday Night with Friends Dinner Party (September 27th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for **The Sunday Night with Friends Dinner Party**\, a warm and
  welcoming evening created for meeting new people\, enjoying good conversa
 tion and sharing a relaxed meal together. Whether you arrive with friends 
 or come on your own\, you’ll be welcomed into a friendly social atmosphe
 re.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fa
 bulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n
 \\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Roa
 d (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in 
 the back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to sh
 ow you to the group (simply ask for Steve's dinner party)*\n\n-You'll find
  it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found 
 on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nS
 teve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Sunday Night with
  Friends Dinner Party**\n\nLooking for a fun and relaxed way to enjoy your
  Sunday evening?\n\n\\*\\*Highlights:\\*\\*\n\n\\* 🍽️ Enjoy a delicio
 us dinner in a relaxed\, friendly setting.\n\\* 😊 Meet new people and r
 econnect with familiar faces.\n\\* 💬 Great conversation\, laughter\, an
 d a welcoming social atmosphere.\n\n**Dinner Party Topics** may include bu
 t not limited too: Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, Moder
 n Dating\, Work/Life balance\, Life after Marriage\, Dating Apps\, Comedy\
 , History\, Art\, Technology\, Economy\, Music\, Movies\, Sports\, Fashion
 \, Hobbies\, Books\, Psychology\, Philosophy\, the Future\, History\, Pop 
 Culture\, Theatre\, etc.)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:** 5 dollars (Ca
 sh only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@g
 mail.com**\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 5
 :30 pm and 6:30 pm (if you can) (please ask for Steve when you arrive-\n\\
 *Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer
  minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**
 \n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps:
 //www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yong
 e & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
