SUMMARY:Music Appreciation from the 1960s to 1980s Social Event! 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a fun and interactive Sunday night celebrating the incredib
 le music of the 1960s\, 1970s and 1980s! We’ll listen to great songs\, s
 hare memories and opinions\, and talk about the artists and music that hel
 ped define three unforgettable decades.\nㅤ\nThis is more than just liste
 ning to music — everyone is encouraged to participate! Whether you grew 
 up with these songs or simply love discovering great music from the past\,
  come spend an enjoyable evening with friends and fellow music lovers.\n
 ㅤ\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabu
 lous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\
 *Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road 
 (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we will be in th
 e back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if you like to show
  you to the group (simply ask for Steve's event-easy to find)*\n-You'll fi
 nd it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking foun
 d on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\
 nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Music Appreciation 
 from the 1960s to 1980s Social Event!**\n(Sunday September 27th)\n\n• Li
 sten to great music from the ’60s\, ’70s and ’80s\n• Share your fa
 vourite songs\, singers and bands\n• Take part in fun\, interactive musi
 c discussions and questions\n• Hear some forgotten gems and rediscover o
 ld favourites\n• Meet other people who enjoy music and good conversation
 \nㅤ\nCome listen\, reminisce\, laugh and enjoy a Sunday night of great m
 usic and great company!\n\n**Steve Flemming** has been a DJ since the earl
 y 2000s with a lifelong passion for music\, especially from the 1960s\, 
 ’70s and ’80s. Raised by a father who was also a DJ during the ’70s 
 and ’80s\, music has always been a big part of Steve’s life. He enjoys
  sharing great songs and bringing people together through music.\n\n**Even
 t Fee:** 5 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfe
 r: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for those attending t
 he earlier events\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6
 :30 pm and 8:00 pm (if you can-arrive earlier if you like) (please ask for
  Steve when you arrive\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:
 \n(One beverage or appetizer minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**P
 arking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free
  residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n
 (15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus
  or uber from the station)
