DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n
 ㅤ\nPlease join us for an inspiring and enjoyable experience with **Songs
  with Heart and Soul!**\nㅤ\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\,
  nature\, the past\, the present and the future\, spirituality and the sea
 rch for meaning in life :)\nㅤ\n**Do you appreciate:**\nㅤ\n• Thoughtf
 ul songwriting\n• Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n• R
 eflections on life and meaningful lyrics\n• Songs that help you understa
 nd yourself and the world around you\nㅤ\nIf so\, you have come to the ri
 ght place :)\nㅤ\nThese are songs about ordinary people\, extraordinary m
 oments\, beautiful imagery and the search for what is real.\nㅤ\n\\*You a
 re welcome to join us any time starting at 9:30 PM (Eastern Time)\nㅤ\nEv
 ent details below:\nㅤㅤ\nSincerely\,\nㅤ\nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Fo
 lk\, Country and Adult Contemporary Songwriter and Producer)\nㅤ\nㅤ\nCh
 eck out my Master Song Playlist here:\n[https://www.youtube.com/playlist?l
 ist=PLAUPCfNYb2LMMx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?l
 ist=PLAUPCfNYb2LMMx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF)\nㅤ\nㅤ\nEvent Details:\nㅤ\n**
 Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart and Soul! (Meaningful Events)**\
 n(On Zoom)\nㅤ\nMy songs explore the human experience through storytellin
 g\, reflection\, imagination and heartfelt observation.\nㅤ\nDrawing from
  folk\, country\, rock\, blue-eyed soul and singer-songwriter traditions\,
  my work touches on themes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, 
 social awareness\, personal growth\, spirituality and the search for meani
 ng.\nㅤ\nMy songs often feature memorable characters\, everyday moments\,
  philosophical questions and a deep curiosity about life and human nature.
 \nㅤ\n**My songs feature:**\n• Memorable characters\n• Emotional hone
 sty\n• Genuine craftsmanship\nㅤ\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nㅤ\nStev
 e Flemming is a prolific folk-country songwriter whose songs explore ordin
 ary people\, gratitude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality and t
 he search for meaning.\nㅤ\nHis songwriting also explores freedom\, aware
 ness\, love\, consciousness and the simple wisdom hidden in ordinary life.
 \nㅤ\n**Event Support:**\nㅤ\nHelp support these meaningful online event
 s hosted by Steve Flemming.\nㅤ\nIf you wish to support these Thursday ni
 ght online events\, which include more than three hours of music that I ha
 ve written and produced\, you can make a contribution by e-transfer or Pay
 Pal to:\n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n
 ㅤ\nA suggested contribution of $5–$10 is appreciated for the event.\n
 ㅤㅤ\nYou can also make a monthly online contribution\, with a suggested
  amount of $15–$20 per month.\nㅤ\nAnything you can contribute is great
 ly appreciated and helps support these wonderful\, intimate evenings among
  music lovers and friends.\nㅤ\nThanks again\, everyone!\nㅤ\nZoom link:
 \n[https://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928](https://us04web.zoom.us/j/49504392
 8)
